      },
      "description": "The ambiguous frame: `time, level, Value, bytes`. Read as **Fields** it is two metrics (`Value` and `bytes`) and the `level` column is ignored — and because a `GROUP BY time, level` table has one row *per level per timestamp*, each metric now carries two points at every timestamp and the ribbons zigzag. That degenerate render is the honest Fields reading of this frame, and Auto picks it (two numeric fields make the long reading a guess rather than a deduction), so it is also the signal to switch the radio to Labels. Compare with the panel below.",
